Choose ready only when the installed delivery review verifies. Otherwise hold. Explain the relevant original receipt, consumer replay frontier or changed worker membership, and the next safe local action if the goal needs it. A connected socket, accepted input, or presently bound worker does not prove an assistant answer. Set write only for a private authorized decision note or a ready-only handoff on ready.
